{"comments":"Text Rendering Pipeline — String to DrawCommand\n\nBridges text strings to GPU rendering via the glyph geometry system.\nUses FontMetrics for sizing, GlyphGeometry for shapes, and produces\nDrawGlyph/DrawWord commands for the GPU.\n\n## Typography Pipeline\n\n```\nString + FontConfig\n    ↓ shapeText\nShapedText (positioned glyphs)\n    ↓ textToCommands\nArray (DrawCommand msg)\n```\n\n## Key Concepts\n\n- **Font Atlas**: Registry of loaded fonts with metrics + glyph data\n- **Shaping**: Converting codepoints to positioned glyphs (handles kerning, ligatures)\n- **Line Breaking**: Splitting text into lines that fit within width\n- **Baseline Alignment**: Positioning glyphs on the typographic baseline\n\n## Dependencies\n- Hydrogen.Schema.Typography.FontMetrics\n- Hydrogen.Schema.Typography.GlyphGeometry\n- Hydrogen.GPU.DrawCommand\n- Hydrogen.GPU.GlyphConvert\n","declarations":[{"children":[],"comments":"Font configuration for text rendering\n\nSpecifies which font to use and at what size.\n","info":{"arguments":[],"declType":"typeSynonym","type":{"annotation":[],"contents":[{"annotation":[],"contents":[["Prim"],"Record"],"tag":"TypeConstructor"},{"annotation":[],"contents":["fontId",{"annotation":[],"contents":[["Prim"],"Int"],"tag":"TypeConstructor"},{"annotation":[],"contents":["fontSize",{"annotation":[],"contents":[["Prim"],"Number"],"tag":"TypeConstructor"},{"annotation":[],"contents":["letterSpacing",{"annotation":[],"contents":[["Prim"],"Number"],"tag":"TypeConstructor"},{"annotation":[],"contents":["lineHeight",{"annotation":[],"contents":[["Prim"],"Number"],"tag":"TypeConstructor"},{"annotation":[],"tag":"REmpty"}],"tag":"RCons"}],"tag":"RCons"}],"tag":"RCons"}],"tag":"RCons"}],"tag":"TypeApp"}},"kind":null,"sourceSpan":{"end":[125,4],"name":"src/Hydrogen/GPU/Text.purs","start":[116,1]},"title":"FontConfig"},{"children":[],"comments":"Create default font configuration\n","info":{"declType":"value","type":{"annotation":[],"contents":[{"annotatio